   "summary": "Absolute chaos. Went in like Bambi with heavy size (2 contracts), ran out of cash and had to use unsettled funds (good-faith violation risk on Webull). When it was time to add size I didn't, then got scared holding \u2014 the put went to about $6.00 and I left with about half of it.",
   "right": "The 7:10 P659 caught the real move: 0.75 -> 3.73, +$298, held 22 minutes. Opening call at 6:30 +$33. Ended green +$161.",
